          "description": "A priest and member of the high-priestly family living during the New Testament, mentioned in Acts 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "fra": {
      "preferred_label": "Alexandre (Actes 4.6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Prêtre et membre de la famille des grands prêtres ayant vécu à l'époque du Nouveau Testament, mentionné en Actes 4.6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "spa": {
      "preferred_label": "Alejandro (Hechos 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Sacerdote y miembro de la familia del sumo sacerdote que vivió durante el Nuevo Testamento, mencionado en Hechos 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "arb": {
      "preferred_label": "ٱلْإِسْكَنْدَرُ (أعمال الرسل 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "كاهن وأحد أفراد عشيرة رؤساء الكهنة عاش في عصر العهد الجديد، ورد ذكره في أعمال الرسل 4: 6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "zhs": {
      "preferred_label": "亚历山大 (使徒行传 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "生活在新约时期的一名祭司，大祭司家族成员，记载于使徒行传4:6。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "hau": {
      "preferred_label": "Alekzanda (Ayyukan Manzanni 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Wani firist kuma ɗan gidan babban firist da ya rayu a zamanin Sabon Alkawari, wanda aka ambata a Ayyukan Manzanni 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "hin": {
      "preferred_label": "सिकन्दर (प्रेरितों के काम 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "नए नियम के समय का एक याजक और महायाजकीय परिवार का सदस्य, जिसका उल्लेख प्रेरितों के काम 4:6 में मिलता है।"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ind": {
      "preferred_label": "Aleksander (Kisah Para Rasul 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Seorang imam dan anggota keluarga imam besar yang hidup pada masa Perjanjian Baru, disebutkan dalam Kisah Para Rasul 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "por": {
      "preferred_label": "Alexandre (Atos 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Um sacerdote e membro da família do sumo sacerdote que viveu durante o Novo Testamento, mencionado em Atos 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "rus": {
      "preferred_label": "Александр (Деяния 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Священник и представитель первосвященнического рода, живший во времена Нового Завета; упоминается в Деяниях 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "swh": {
      "preferred_label": "Iskanda (Matendo ya Mitume 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Kuhani na mshiriki wa jamaa ya kuhani mkuu aliyeishi wakati wa Agano Jipya, anayetajwa katika Matendo ya Mitume 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "tpi": {
      "preferred_label": "Aleksander (Wok bilong Ol Aposel 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Wanpela pris na wanpela long lain famili bilong hetpris i bin stap long taim bilong Nupela Testamen, em Aposel 4:6 i kolim nem bilong en."
        }
      ]
    },
    "apd": {
      "preferred_label": "إسكندر (أعمال الرسل 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "كاهن وفرد من عيلة رئيس الكهنة عاش في زمن العهد الجديد، مذكور في أعمال الرسل 4: 6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "bis": {
      "preferred_label": "Aleksanda (Wok blong ol Aposol 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Wan pris mo memba blong famle blong hae pris we i laef long taem blong Niu Testeman, we Ol Wok 4:6 i tokbaot hem."
        }
      ]
    },
    "ibo": {
      "preferred_label": "Alegzanda (Ọrụ Ndị Ozi 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Onye nchụaja na onye ezinụlọ onyeisi nchụaja nke biri nʼoge Ọgbụgba Ndụ Ọhụrụ, nke a kpọtụrụ aha nʼỌrụ Ndị Ozi 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "nep": {
      "preferred_label": "अलेक्जेन्डर (प्रेरितहरूका काम 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "नयाँ नियमको समयमा बाँचेका एक पूजाहारी र प्रधान पूजाहारीका परिवारका सदस्य, जसको उल्लेख प्रेरित ४:६ मा गरिएको छ।"
        }
      ]
    },
    "vie": {
      "preferred_label": "A-lét-xan-đơ (Công Vụ Các Sứ Đồ 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Một thầy tế lễ và là thành viên trong gia tộc thầy thượng tế sống vào thời Tân Ước, được đề cập trong Công Vụ 4:6."
        }
      ]
    },
    "zht": {
      "preferred_label": "亞歷山大 (使徒行傳 4:6)",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "新約時期的一名祭司和大祭司家族成員，記載於使徒行傳4:6。"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
